# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=wireplumber
pkgver=0.5.10
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="WirePlumber: PipeWire's session manager (which device plays what)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://pipewire.pages.freedesktop.org/wireplumber/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(glibc pipewire glib lua systemd)
install=wireplumber.install
source=("https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/wireplumber/-/archive/$pkgver/wireplumber-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    meson setup wireplumber-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release --wrap-mode=nofallback \
        -D system-lua=true -D introspection=disabled -D doc=disabled -D tests=false \
        -D elogind=disabled -D systemd=enabled -D systemd-user-service=true
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
